Pari-mutuel wagering-breakage. 25LSO-0053, 1.0
FISCAL NOTE
FY 2026 FY 2027 FY 2028
NON-ADMINISTRATIVE IMPACT
Anticipated Revenue increase
SPECIAL REVENUE FUND $685,000 $706,000 $727,000
Source of revenue increase:
This bill requires the distribution of historic pari-mutuel breakage amounts to
be distributed to the pari-mutuel account.
Assumptions:
The above estimate is based on the average breakage amount over the last 5
months, annualized to arrive at an annual estimate. A 3 percent annual increase
in wagering handle is assumed.
